[8501]="70022D63\n1\tTalk to Mainio at Taur Orthon in Forochel\tTaur Orthon is north of Ost Forod in Evendim in the frozen land of Forochel. Mainio stated that he awaits anyone who will come outside of the settlement. Mainio, acting against his elders, has asked for assistance in Forochel.\n",
[8502]="7002597B\n1\tTalk to a Ranger at the colossus in Evendim\tThe Ranger-camp is believed to be at the colossus guarding a bridge where Lake Evendim flows into the Brandywine. Hob Hillbrow is worried about the Rangers to the north, having heard nothing from them in a great deal of time. He would like you to seek them out.\n",
[8503]="70015E10\n1\tDefeat Dunlendings in Porth Cadlus (total: 15)\tPorth Cadlus is south and slightly west of Echad Dúnann, across Nan Sirannon. Glavroleth has asked you to defeat Dunlendings in Porth Cadlus in hopes of routing the enemy from Eregion.\n2\tTalk to Glavroleth at Echad Dúnann\tGlavroleth is at Echad Dúnann, north and slightly east of Porth Cadlus. You should return to Glavroleth and tell her of your success.\n",
[8504]="70054669\n1\tDefeat Ungoledain (total: 12)\tUnoledain have set up camp in Cadar Skûs, a small village in western Cirith Ungol. You should defeat Ungoledain in Cadar Skûs.\n2\tTalk to Legolas\tMany Ungoledain have been defeated this day. You should talk to Legolas.\n",
